WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:07.390
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.530
Ikumi... tell me...!

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.900
Please. Let me hear it.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.280
I made a promise to Kozue.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:57.080
I said I'd protect her,
that I'd be sure to protect her.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.750
But hell, I couldn't do a thing!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.480
I wasn't able to do a thing!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:08.620
Were you aware, Sis?
That this is the extent of my abilities?

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.790
Is that why you went away?

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:17.430
Please answer me. I beg you. Sister...!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:26.000
SISTER!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.580
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:38.120
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.130
Although loneliness...

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:46.460
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:53.700
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.780
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.750
...and hurt by others as well

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:09.280
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:13.060
...the dream and the reality...

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:16.690
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.390
Some light is shed...

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:24.970
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:32.210
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:40.210
The things I want have no shape

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:48.620
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:02.830
Smiling with You

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.120
Lives were lost!

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.820
- As Captain, you're responsible!
- Are you trying to kill us?

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.690
Say something!

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:27.460
The fact we lost lives,
and that people were left to worry...

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:29.620
...were all a result of a lack
of abilities on my part.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.200
I apologize.
I am deeply sorry for what happened.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:37.260
- We don't want any apologies!
- Find a way outta this mess!

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.880
You guys do know the
harm you've done, right?

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.310
This is why we can't trust
a woman to take charge.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.250
Say something!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.610
You murderer!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.550
Then what do you want
me to do about it?

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.260
Are you resigning from
your position as Captain?

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.060
I didn't become Captain
because I wanted to.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.900
I didn't even become
a Zwei by choice.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:06.670
I don't even intend to be a soldier.
I just wanted a scholarship.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.400
Because... I'm an orphan.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:16.970
That's all!

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.920
Why did Kozue leave, anyway?

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.390
I dunno.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.050
Let's ask Reiko. She's there, right?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.430
Don't. Some things are
better left unknown.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:35.390
If you try too hard to get involved,
you could regret it.

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.630
Wh-What was that?

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.080
<i>Kozue. How could something</i>
<i>like this happen?</i>

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.090
How is she?

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.560
She wouldn't answer.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.650
I see. You understand why she might
not want to see you, don't you?

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.330
That's why we had her transferred
to an officers' room.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.190
So let's just leave her alone for now.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.610
- Leave her alone?
- It's all we can do.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:18.370
That's sophistry. Leaving her alone is
no different than not doing anything.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.470
- I'm just doing what I can for Kozue...!
- What you're doing is selfish!

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.450
She's my friend!

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:26.470
That's right. That's why she may not
want to share some things with you.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.980
Taking action isn't always the best answer.
Sometimes, it's necessary to stay put.

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:33.750
- That's crazy!
- Aoi!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:37.250
You'd only hurt her by seeing her!
And you'll get hurt too!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.460
Stop acting like an adult!

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.120
Listen, Aoi!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:47.800
But, it's Kozue.
Kozue is... a friend is hurt.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:51.500
Why can't I do anything?
Why mustn't I...?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.210
Answer me, Kouji!

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:59.310
- Answer me!
- Kouji! It's Ikumi.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:02.310
Why didn't you stop them? Why?

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.190
I didn't think they would go this far.

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:09.160
I intervened! Over and over.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.920
But, she kept getting on their nerves.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.760
So how else was I to handle things?

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.500
Look at me when you talk to me.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:29.610
You knew, right?
You knew about it, right?

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:34.380
Your eyes say so.
You've abandoned your friend!

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.180
But I... I...!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.310
You abandoned Kozue!

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:41.950
I... I...!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.360
Ikumi!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:51.900
Ikumi...!

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:55.130
Reiko. I don't wanna ever see you again.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.010
If you ever appear before me, I won't
show leniency just because you're a girl.

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.110
Ikumi!

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:03.080
Aoi, take care of Reiko.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.650
Wait. Wait for me, Ikumi.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.380
Hey, where are you going?
I'm telling you to wait.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:11.920
- Don't touch me!
- Calm down!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:15.850
What are you saying, Kouji?
Your logical arguments are too painful!

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.930
I beg you to listen to me. Okay, Ikumi?

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:21.300
Could you have stopped it?
Well, could you?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:24.100
No one saw this coming.
No one could've avoided it.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.940
I'll stop it.
No matter what it takes to do it!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.170
It wasn't your fault.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:31.010
It <i>was</i> my fault. Damn.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.770
How many times must we repeat this?

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.680
Answer me, Kouji! Well, tell me!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.150
Answer me!

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:40.080
It's impossible to save everyone.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.950
All we can do is what
we can right now.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:47.180
The strength of one
individual has its limits.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.620
Enough with the crap!

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:59.400
I'm moving to the officers' room.
I'll protect Kozue there.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:03.130
Judging from your argument,
you won't be able to protect Aoi.

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:06.710
If you consider Aoi important,
guard her with your life.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:10.010
If your feelings for her aren't that strong,
have Yuki look after her.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.980
- What do you...?
- Well, I said it.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:14.020
Why?

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.380
You involved yourself
too deeply, Kouji.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.620
That's not in your character, Kouji.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.630
If you try too hard, you'll end up failing.

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:27.220
Guys like you and I are
better off staying quiet.

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:29.900
No.

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:33.770
You and I are not the same!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.250
Michelle.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:48.050
Sorry I'm late. It wasn't easy
getting the password to this room.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.250
Thank you.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.060
- Are you all right?
- Mhm.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.430
Why not leave this guy behind?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.030
I can't exactly do that.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.700
What do you plan to do now?

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.830
I'll make some allies and free Fu and Son.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.160
And then I'm gonna destroy
that traitor, Blue.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.200
I won't ever forgive him.

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.670
Michelle. Let's call it quits.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.610
This quarrelling against
each other is meaningless.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.140
What are you saying?
Is your brain experiencing a meltdown?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.680
I just wanna live peacefully.
That's why I'm gonna stay with him.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.780
He has accepted everything about me.

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:27.990
A-Are you outta your mind?

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.660
Is this some kinda joke?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.870
You serious?

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:38.530
I'm remaining with him.
Good Turtleland the Third.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.840
Call me Charlie, Criff.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:47.710
Criff!

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.780
I saved you because you're my sister...

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.780
...and this is the attitude
you repay me with?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:53.820
Michelle.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.790
Don't talk to me so casually.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.020
You can play your lovey-dovey
games on your own, you fool!

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.860
From now on, you and I are strangers!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.190
- Is it okay?
- She's a strong girl.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.930
<i>I'm not gonna remain tucked away</i>
<i>in the background.</i>

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.510
<i>I've thought so all along,</i>
<i>and that's why I've made it this far.</i>

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.030
<i>I'm never returning to that place.</i>
<i>Never again.</i>

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.950
Kozue. Don't forget to lock the door.
No matter what.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.650
I'll be on my way!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:39.990
Boss.
Are you sure you don't have to work?

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.160
Shut up! Kick!

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:49.000
Who does he think he is, taking all that food?

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:52.840
He'd better not believe he's getting away
with that special status thing forever.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.010
<i>I'm not gonna say that</i>
<i>I can't do anything.</i>

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:58.740
<i>There are things that I myself can do.</i>
<i>There must be. That's why I!</i>

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.120
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.090
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.660
Kozue. You're there, right?
Kozue!

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.900
Let me in, Kozue.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:23.700
And we'll all get together and have a ball,
like we did back on Liebe Delta.

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:27.640
Hey, do you remember?
The time we all partied back then.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.940
Kouji threw up on Ikumi's clothes,
making them all soggy, and...

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.450
...and then... and then...!

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:37.420
Do you really think it'll be the same?

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.460
Sure it will!

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:41.820
We can make it that way!
Of course we can!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:43.830
- Really?
- Yeah.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:44.950
Stop lying!

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:51.200
I should've gone home during
the Liebe Delta "dive". Why did I stay?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.990
But I'm glad I didn't go home.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:12:00.030
Because Ikumi's here.
Ikumi's watching over me.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:04.210
When Ikumi and I kissed,
I thought something wasn't right.

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.520
We weren't connected.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:11.390
But it's different now.
Ikumi's thinking of me first and foremost.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:14.830
He wants to make sure
I never get hurt again.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.920
I almost wanna thank
God for what happened.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.730
You're mistaken. Ikumi...!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.700
I don't care if I'm mistaken!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.490
Are you okay with that?
Are you really okay with that?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.960
You wouldn't understand. Not the way
you drift between the Aiba brohers, Aoi.

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:30.070
Me?

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:34.180
You say you want the two to get along,
yet you want them both to care about you.

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:38.050
W-Well, that's... I... I don't follow you.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:39.980
You liar!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.780
You're deceiving yourself!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.150
There's no way you'd understand.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.210
You don't believe that you have
what you want, yet you do!

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.860
And you've done nothing to earn it!

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:51.950
So there's no way you'd understand
how I feel! Absolutely no way!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.400
You felt so all along?

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.730
And that's not everything. You're unfair.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.070
You're unfair because you don't realize it.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:10.170
I want Ikumi. I don't want anything else.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.610
Ikumi alone will do.
Ikumi's everything to me.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.380
I'm not like you, who wants them both!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:18.820
Don't ever come here again!
Go away, now!

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:37.430
What's this? I look so childish.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.910
Kouji. Kouji?

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.600
I don't want all that much.

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:05.300
I just want a little happiness.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.730
And someone who will be with me.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:12.470
I'm quite impressed that you even
washed your clothes on your own, Pat.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.740
You will grow up to be
an excellent Zwei member.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:17.780
Lucson, I'll be a much,
much greater Zwei member than you.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.880
What did you say?

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:28.460
Do you... both of you... understand
the situation we're in?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.500
I'm not sure what just happened,
but I'm sorry, Juli. I apologize.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.540
U-Um...!

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:58.260
What do you want?

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:01.880
Food. There's not much here,
but I brought stuff that won't go bad.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.330
I'll leave it here.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.390
- Why are you helping me?
- I feel that it's the right thing to do.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.700
Even though I betrayed you?

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.190
I'm pissed off about that. But...!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.470
You're a strange guy, you know.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:19.370
Not really. I'm normal.
That's why I came here.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.540
In the present situation we're in?
That's what's strange.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.780
I-I'll brief you on the situation.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.720
The Ryvius has taken a course that'll
take it away from the vicinity of Saturn.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.830
There's no word yet on
any help coming our way.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.290
Fu, Son, and the others are
confined in officers' rooms.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.260
They've been receiving meals,
so there's no worry there.

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:43.890
But in general, people are outta control.
The situation is hopeless.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.110
- Keep it.
- Huh? But why?

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:55.300
It's better that a guy like you have it.
And I'm also interested.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.580
- To see how you would use it.
- I won't use it.

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.050
Keep it!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:03.950
All right!

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:05.860
What the...!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.690
Ume! What do you think you're doing,
not even working?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.130
Let me do as I wish!
We're not gonna be rescued anyway.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.490
Yeah. It's foolish working for nothing.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.170
Well, you may be right, but...!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.130
H-Hey!

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.590
Isn't that Kouji?

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:22.360
No. Not me. I've got stuff to do.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.710
I won't make such a mistake. No way.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.640
You damn special status bastard!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:33.880
Where'd you take that food?

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.920
Why must we go through this?

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.160
You're not taking us seriously, are you?

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.880
Direct the Ryvius to Earth!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.590
I... won't do it!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:03.480
I thought I told you! Doing nothing but
complain is no different from being dead!

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.250
Yuki.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.530
Wh-Where's Yuki?

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.020
He went off somewhere.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.990
He must really hate you, Big Brother.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.230
Looks that way.
Thank you for treating my wounds.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.230
- I'll be on my way.
- Yuki tries to do everything on his own.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:32.230
He has a strong aversion to people,
yet he wants recognition for what he does.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.640
Why is that?
Tell me.

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.710
I have no idea either.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.880
It's not that I want any trouble with him.

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:45.220
All I want is for all of us on the Ryvius to
live without any trouble until help arrives.

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:49.190
That's all I hope for.
Am I trying to do more than I'm capable of?

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:50.760
Not at all!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.060
You just need to make a priority list.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:55.770
You don't have to make any special effort
but make up your mind to do them.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:58.270
Just by doing that, you should be
able to overcome almost anything.

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.740
- You think so?
- Yeah.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.530
What is your present top priority?

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:03.540
Yuki Aiba.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:04.900
Even though you may die?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:08.770
People all die eventually.
That's why I do what I want.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.940
I can understand why you'd
be attracted to Yuki.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:13.750
He's becoming greater and greater.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.780
I believe I recognize his
skills more than anyone.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:19.590
Why don't you simply tell him so?

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.450
Hey, what's your top priority,
Big Brother?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:25.960
Mine?

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:28.560
The one thing you must do
right now more than anything.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:34.260
Return to my room, perhaps?
Yeah, that's probably at the top of my list.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.400
Did that please you?

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:48.020
<i>You've confirmed once again</i>
<i>that you're a piece of junk...</i>

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.850
<i>A piece of junk beyond repair.</i>

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.730
I hope you had a good day.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:00.130
I got some great looking food for
you, so eat well, and get well.

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:03.760
Welcome home, Ikumi.

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.500
Is something wrong?

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:09.040
You... kinda surprised me.

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:14.340
It's just funny... that you're crying.

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:18.110
You're right.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:19.980
Did you get something in your eyes?

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:24.110
No, I didn't. That's not why.
That's not the reason!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.720
I'll protect you.
I'll be sure to protect you this time.

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:33.030
I promise. So... So...
Please don't go away.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:37.290
- Can I count on you?
- Yes.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.990
- It's a promise.
- Yes.

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.640
<i>You look pathetic, Kouji.</i>
<i>You're all messed up.</i>

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:54.540
<i>Hey, what can you do for Kozue?</i>
<i>What can you do for Ikumi?</i>

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:58.750
<i>What can you do for everyone?</i>
<i>What must you do now?</i>

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:03.820
<i>No, what is it that you</i>
<i>want to do now? What is it?</i>

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:07.890
What I want to do now. What I...!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.160
If you wanna cry, then you should cry.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.700
You talk like you know how I feel.
Well, not that I care.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:17.510
Aren't you going to cry?

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:18.970
I knew it. You do want to cry.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:22.800
I think it's important at times
not to cry even if you want to.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:25.480
I can't really explain it,
but I think it's true.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.270
Right now, I'd rather laugh.
I wanna laugh.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.950
- You want to laugh?
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:34.120
Oh.

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.460
By the way,
I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:39.050
My name's Kouji Aiba. What's yours?

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.870
- Neya.
- Neya?

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.840
You know, it's not safe for a
girl to be walking around alone.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.860
If you want, I can walk you back.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.770
No, it's okay. I'll be fine.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:52.540
Okay, then. Bye.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:48.960
Aoi. It's me.
I'm coming in. Hi.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.500
I'm sorry. Reiko

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.300
<i>I'm all alone now.</i>

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:00.640
<i>But how?</i>

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:03.710
<i>How?</i>

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:06.410
How am I supposed to laugh?

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:13.980
In your dry eyes...

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:19.050
...a silhouette appears

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:23.750
The blue colored future...

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:30.490
...swayed and glittered

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:39.900
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:48.510
...freedom out of pity

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:56.950
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:00.860
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:23:00.860 --> 00:23:07.230
goodbye

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:12.820
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:13.990
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:16.120
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go
Aoi is forced to face loneliness.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:19.290
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go
Ikumi suffers from an
incident he cannot do anything about.

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:21.460
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go
And my own feelings continue to waver.

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:23.970
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go
There are things that people can't let go.

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:28.000
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go
However, after a certain point,
people will change.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:31.300
Next episode: Something I Can't Let Go
People will change this easily!
